{"clientRequestId":"convict-conditioning-pushups-v1-local-20260809","payloadHash":"b686712942810b38bd2d6c191f2c4aecae07068af54259d6f2dc08b641c13559","status":"succeeded","response":{"publicActionId":"8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW","title":"俯卧撑十式跟练","description":"从墙壁俯卧撑循序渐进到单臂俯卧撑，建立上肢推力、躯干张力和肩肘控制。如有肩、肘、腕疼痛或康复需求，请先咨询专业医生或康复师；出现刺痛、麻木或关节不适时立即停止。","iconCode":"fitness","colorCode":"mint","category":"fitness","tags":["跟练计划","自重训练","俯卧撑"],"template":{"title":"俯卧撑十式跟练","description":"从墙壁俯卧撑循序渐进到单臂俯卧撑，建立上肢推力、躯干张力和肩肘控制。如有肩、肘、腕疼痛或康复需求，请先咨询专业医生或康复师；出现刺痛、麻木或关节不适时立即停止。","iconCode":"fitness","colorCode":"mint","scheduleType":"daily","scheduleConfigJson":"{}","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","deadlineLocalTime":"20:30","gracePolicy":"none","completionMode":"one_tap","contentMode":"follow_along","followPlan":{"afterCompletionPolicy":"continue_last_level","levels":[{"title":"墙壁俯卧撑","description":"用最小负荷熟悉推起和身体成一直线的感觉。","targetSessions":6,"promotionCriterion":"能稳定完成3组，每组40-50次，动作全程可控。","estMinutes":8,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"面对墙站立，双脚并拢或与髋同宽，双手扶墙与胸同高。吸气弯曲手肘，让额头或胸口方向靠近墙面；呼气推回。保持身体成一条直线，不塌腰、不耸肩。完成2-3组，每组留2-3次余力。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/content/6d72a365b03f648983834aa1e731cce63de4b69036ef5793a1c4be9a2795ff45.png","caption":"身体一线，慢下稳推；注意不塌腰、不耸肩。"}]},{"title":"上斜俯卧撑","description":"把支点从墙面降低到桌沿、栏杆或稳固台面。","targetSessions":6,"promotionCriterion":"能稳定完成3组，每组30-40次。","estMinutes":10,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"双手撑在稳固高台上，脚向后退，身体从头到脚保持直线。缓慢下降到胸口接近支撑面，再推回起点。选择不会滑动的支撑物，动作中肩胛保持稳定，腰腹持续收紧。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/content/3b90fa38bcd57609a4ebbacdd7ffada3a480fa818a02bb861bc35ce3803d4551.png","caption":"撑稳桌边，身体成线；注意桌椅稳固、不塌腰。"}]},{"title":"跪姿俯卧撑","description":"进入地面推力训练，同时降低完整俯卧撑负荷。","targetSessions":7,"promotionCriterion":"能完成3组，每组25-30次，髋部不后坐。","estMinutes":10,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"双膝着地，双手略宽于肩，身体从头到膝盖保持直线。下降时胸口靠近地面，底部停顿一瞬再推起。不要把臀部留在后方，也不要用腰部塌陷换次数。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/content/6dc5c7cf4ba9e84141b0fda78a43a1634603b6bd8851c60fb12ec3d95d08ac59.png","caption":"头膝一线，胸口下沉；注意髋不后坐、肩不耸。"}]},{"title":"半程俯卧撑","description":"以完整支撑姿势训练上半程控制。","targetSessions":7,"promotionCriterion":"能完成2-3组，每组20-25次，半程深度一致。","estMinutes":12,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"进入标准俯卧撑支撑位，在胸下放一个安全高度的参照物。下降到约半程后停住，再推回顶端。保持腿、髋、躯干同时移动，不让肩膀单独前冲。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/content/e46db380e9255ea490baebab07d087e67e0526f20138490d6012ab7f9f94db9c.png","caption":"半程一致，核心收紧；注意不用弹震、不塌腰。"}]},{"title":"标准俯卧撑","description":"建立完整俯卧撑的基础力量和节奏。","targetSessions":8,"promotionCriterion":"能完成2-3组，每组15-20次，底部停顿不借力。","estMinutes":12,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"双手撑地略宽于肩，脚尖着地，身体保持直线。用2秒下降、底部短暂停顿、2秒推起的节奏练习。每次到底部都保持胸、肩、肘可控，不用弹震抢次数。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/content/fa720ec1606860a6db98f581c2007f05246da1a0ad1a6381ff49787b559ef110.png","caption":"全身成线，胸口靠近；注意不塌腰、不抢速。"}]},{"title":"窄距俯卧撑","description":"缩小手距，提高肱三头肌、胸肩稳定和躯干控制要求。","targetSessions":8,"promotionCriterion":"能完成2组，每组15-20次，肘腕无不适。","estMinutes":12,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"双手放在胸下方，手距比标准俯卧撑更窄。下降时手肘贴近身体两侧，推起时保持肩膀下沉。若手腕压力明显，先略微放宽手距，确保动作稳定再继续推进。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/content/8f3434d16fc3c7d7257c2b727184ceca3b5ccef9e0250175fb561879231a70c1.png","caption":"手距收窄，肘贴身体；手腕不适时先放宽手距。"}]},{"title":"偏重俯卧撑","description":"一侧手放在球、砖或低支撑物上，让另一侧承担更多负荷。","targetSessions":9,"promotionCriterion":"左右两侧都能完成2组，每组12-15次。","estMinutes":14,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"一只手撑地，另一只手放在稳固的低支撑物上。下降时身体仍保持正对地面，主要用撑地侧发力推起。左右交替训练，避免身体旋转或把重量全部压到肩关节。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/content/b0b39de4a2781834312de0f2c0e766650544fbfb17a9c2e1295e72c921dbea5e.png","caption":"一侧主力，身体不旋；左右都练，辅助侧不抢力。"}]},{"title":"半程单臂俯卧撑","description":"进入单臂支撑模式，先控制半程范围。","targetSessions":10,"promotionCriterion":"左右两侧都能完成2组，每组8-10次。","estMinutes":15,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"双脚分开增加稳定，一手背在身后，另一手撑地。只下降到半程，保持骨盆尽量水平，再推回顶端。把注意力放在肩、髋、腹同时锁住，宁可少做也不要扭身借力。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/content/6ec4b51993f2ec2786e1bcbb2a440664050400297b09d5ee6ee8da627afde066.png","caption":"单手支撑，只做半程；注意骨盆别转、不要硬撑。"}]},{"title":"杠杆俯卧撑","description":"辅助手臂伸远，只提供平衡，主力侧接近单臂发力。","targetSessions":10,"promotionCriterion":"左右两侧都能完成2组，每组8-10次，辅助侧不抢力。","estMinutes":15,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"一手撑在胸下作为主力，另一手向侧方伸远，指尖或掌根轻触地面辅助平衡。下降和推起都由主力侧完成，辅助侧只防止身体旋转。左右各练，动作全程慢而稳。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/content/cd2006a9fcde817791c5f4805fd881ed7d5ddad7732fa4e47abb6b3e6658f792.png","caption":"主手发力，辅手伸远；辅助手只负责稳定平衡。"}]},{"title":"单臂俯卧撑","description":"俯卧撑路线的主目标，考验单侧推力和全身抗旋转能力。","targetSessions":12,"promotionCriterion":"左右两侧都能完成2组，每组5-10次，动作范围完整。","estMinutes":16,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"双脚分开，单手撑在胸下略外侧，另一手背在身后。吸气缓慢下降，保持肩、髋尽量朝向地面；呼气推起。每次只做高质量次数，身体扭转或塌腰时立刻停止本组。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/content/05d91f7cbb5d70fb3d1be09d61aa7d427a0b10d9859c5332910ee91884ec298e.png","caption":"单臂主推，全身抗旋；少量高质量，不扭身。"}]}],"checkpoints":[{"levelIndex":2,"title":"完成入门推力","description":"能稳定完成跪姿俯卧撑，说明肩肘腕已适应基础推力。","isKey":false},{"levelIndex":4,"title":"标准俯卧撑达标","description":"标准俯卧撑动作稳定，可进入更偏力量的窄距与单侧准备。","isKey":true},{"levelIndex":6,"title":"单侧准备完成","description":"偏重俯卧撑左右平衡，为单臂路线建立基础。","isKey":false},{"levelIndex":9,"title":"俯卧撑十式通关","description":"能完成可控单臂俯卧撑，保留最后练阶继续巩固。","isKey":true}]}},"actionType":"follow_along","planSummary":{"levelCount":10,"targetSessions":83,"estMinutes":1072},"coverImageUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/cover/6d72a365b03f648983834aa1e731cce63de4b69036ef5793a1c4be9a2795ff45.png","clientRequestId":"convict-conditioning-pushups-v1-local-20260809","payloadHash":"60079930f7e2b5153bf9e009704c19f2b9246ae1c0ab49dc5b498f94c065ec26","assets":[{"assetId":"cover","role":"cover","url":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/cover/6d72a365b03f648983834aa1e731cce63de4b69036ef5793a1c4be9a2795ff45.png","contentType":"image/png","sizeBytes":1707713,"sha256":"6d72a365b03f648983834aa1e731cce63de4b69036ef5793a1c4be9a2795ff45"},{"assetId":"step-01","role":"content","url":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/content/6d72a365b03f648983834aa1e731cce63de4b69036ef5793a1c4be9a2795ff45.png","contentType":"image/png","sizeBytes":1707713,"sha256":"6d72a365b03f648983834aa1e731cce63de4b69036ef5793a1c4be9a2795ff45"},{"assetId":"step-02","role":"content","url":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/content/3b90fa38bcd57609a4ebbacdd7ffada3a480fa818a02bb861bc35ce3803d4551.png","contentType":"image/png","sizeBytes":1728278,"sha256":"3b90fa38bcd57609a4ebbacdd7ffada3a480fa818a02bb861bc35ce3803d4551"},{"assetId":"step-03","role":"content","url":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/8vvA8oAOvT3yrfTwjReYW/content/6dc5c7cf4ba9e84141b0fda78a43a1634603b6bd8851c60fb12ec3d95d08ac59.png","contentType":"image/png","sizeBytes":1508445,"sha256":"6dc5c7cf4ba9e84141b0fda78a43a1634603b6bd8851c60fb12ec3d95d08ac59"},{"assetId":"step-04","role":"content","url":"htt