locks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"双膝着地，双手略宽于肩，身体从头到膝盖保持直线。下降时胸口靠近地面，底部停顿一瞬再推起。不要把臀部留在后方，也不要用腰部塌陷换次数。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/1s4MAATUY7R4yvNjXSQiQF/content/659acc924377cd77c3ae330da7d2ec7507b0f7b3c89cbd2eca7fff74b0b1eeb9.jpg","caption":"头膝一线，胸口下沉；注意髋不后坐、肩不耸。"}]},{"title":"半程俯卧撑","description":"以完整支撑姿势训练上半程控制。","targetSessions":7,"promotionCriterion":"能完成2-3组，每组20-25次，半程深度一致。","estMinutes":12,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"进入标准俯卧撑支撑位，在胸下放一个安全高度的参照物。下降到约半程后停住，再推回顶端。保持腿、髋、躯干同时移动，不让肩膀单独前冲。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/1s4MAATUY7R4yvNjXSQiQF/content/f30cbe8e1491abc8632a80e3172e78e8fca5a4e4c0ebcbd86953458650a925aa.jpg","caption":"半程一致，核心收紧；注意不用弹震、不塌腰。"}]},{"title":"标准俯卧撑","description":"建立完整俯卧撑的基础力量和节奏。","targetSessions":8,"promotionCriterion":"能完成2-3组，每组15-20次，底部停顿不借力。","estMinutes":12,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"双手撑地略宽于肩，脚尖着地，身体保持直线。用2秒下降、底部短暂停顿、2秒推起的节奏练习。每次到底部都保持胸、肩、肘可控，不用弹震抢次数。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/1s4MAATUY7R4yvNjXSQiQF/content/4e010a49a6482dbbf89aeb2b462d7b91690520149ee95bceefaeef5c9704f30d.jpg","caption":"全身成线，胸口靠近；注意不塌腰、不抢速。"}]},{"title":"窄距俯卧撑","description":"缩小手距，提高肱三头肌、胸肩稳定和躯干控制要求。","targetSessions":8,"promotionCriterion":"能完成2组，每组15-20次，肘腕无不适。","estMinutes":12,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"双手放在胸下方，手距比标准俯卧撑更窄。下降时手肘贴近身体两侧，推起时保持肩膀下沉。若手腕压力明显，先略微放宽手距，确保动作稳定再继续推进。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/1s4MAATUY7R4yvNjXSQiQF/content/fe07b92490c474e1c6f311496c677a4c8813b775d74a8427c435dfe1f17aa7e2.jpg","caption":"手距收窄，肘贴身体；手腕不适时先放宽手距。"}]},{"title":"偏重俯卧撑","description":"一侧手放在球、砖或低支撑物上，让另一侧承担更多负荷。","targetSessions":9,"promotionCriterion":"左右两侧都能完成2组，每组12-15次。","estMinutes":14,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"一只手撑地，另一只手放在稳固的低支撑物上。下降时身体仍保持正对地面，主要用撑地侧发力推起。左右交替训练，避免身体旋转或把重量全部压到肩关节。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/1s4MAATUY7R4yvNjXSQiQF/content/8d1f99b86c04932ae562fe4ec27c953d95b99669933d8bc1c8d8f76c88db49bb.jpg","caption":"一侧主力，身体不旋；左右都练，辅助侧不抢力。"}]},{"title":"半程单臂俯卧撑","description":"进入单臂支撑模式，先控制半程范围。","targetSessions":10,"promotionCriterion":"左右两侧都能完成2组，每组8-10次。","estMinutes":15,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"双脚分开增加稳定，一手背在身后，另一手撑地。只下降到半程，保持骨盆尽量水平，再推回顶端。把注意力放在肩、髋、腹同时锁住，宁可少做也不要扭身借力。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/1s4MAATUY7R4yvNjXSQiQF/content/207b22f83d789a7d700b53163fb2b680b13cd98b8bad9f67d1048494b6f4d6f2.jpg","caption":"单手支撑，只做半程；注意骨盆别转、不要硬撑。"}]},{"title":"杠杆俯卧撑","description":"辅助手臂伸远，只提供平衡，主力侧接近单臂发力。","targetSessions":10,"promotionCriterion":"左右两侧都能完成2组，每组8-10次，辅助侧不抢力。","estMinutes":15,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"一手撑在胸下作为主力，另一手向侧方伸远，指尖或掌根轻触地面辅助平衡。下降和推起都由主力侧完成，辅助侧只防止身体旋转。左右各练，动作全程慢而稳。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/1s4MAATUY7R4yvNjXSQiQF/content/197aa6282e041aca15be35e7a322d03e71949c5abccc21e1b8df97c65223cc15.jpg","caption":"主手发力，辅手伸远；辅助手只负责稳定平衡。"}]},{"title":"单臂俯卧撑","description":"俯卧撑路线的主目标，考验单侧推力和全身抗旋转能力。","targetSessions":12,"promotionCriterion":"左右两侧都能完成2组，每组5-10次，动作范围完整。","estMinutes":16,"contentBlocks":[{"blockType":"text","textContent":"双脚分开，单手撑在胸下略外侧，另一手背在身后。吸气缓慢下降，保持肩、髋尽量朝向地面；呼气推起。每次只做高质量次数，身体扭转或塌腰时立刻停止本组。"},{"blockType":"image","mediaUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/1s4MAATUY7R4yvNjXSQiQF/content/bcedecfa89cfa3f8b1d2b33d19c963de38a25b3cf03cdc0e555b14736a3a4859.jpg","caption":"单臂主推，全身抗旋；少量高质量，不扭身。"}]}],"checkpoints":[{"levelIndex":2,"title":"完成入门推力","description":"能稳定完成跪姿俯卧撑，说明肩肘腕已适应基础推力。","isKey":false},{"levelIndex":4,"title":"标准俯卧撑达标","description":"标准俯卧撑动作稳定，可进入更偏力量的窄距与单侧准备。","isKey":true},{"levelIndex":6,"title":"单侧准备完成","description":"偏重俯卧撑左右平衡，为单臂路线建立基础。","isKey":false},{"levelIndex":9,"title":"俯卧撑十式通关","description":"能完成可控单臂俯卧撑，保留最后练阶继续巩固。","isKey":true}]}},"actionType":"follow_along","planSummary":{"levelCount":10,"targetSessions":83,"estMinutes":1072},"coverImageUrl":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/1s4MAATUY7R4yvNjXSQiQF/cover/2a56875929ac5db56d8a17c0beb2e04c11058fa0cbec8cdf7de7f57d1689e314.jpg","clientRequestId":"convict-conditioning-pushups-v2-optimized-20260809","payloadHash":"2fbf9b0d14649d440a5a371ad1788dd287997c557a80dcf92889c2cd63dcad88","assets":[{"assetId":"cover","role":"cover","url":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/1s4MAATUY7R4yvNjXSQiQF/cover/2a56875929ac5db56d8a17c0beb2e04c11058fa0cbec8cdf7de7f57d1689e314.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","sizeBytes":188642,"sha256":"2a56875929ac5db56d8a17c0beb2e04c11058fa0cbec8cdf7de7f57d1689e314"},{"assetId":"step-01","role":"content","url":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/1s4MAATUY7R4yvNjXSQiQF/content/2a56875929ac5db56d8a17c0beb2e04c11058fa0cbec8cdf7de7f57d1689e314.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","sizeBytes":188642,"sha256":"2a56875929ac5db56d8a17c0beb2e04c11058fa0cbec8cdf7de7f57d1689e314"},{"assetId":"step-02","role":"content","url":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/1s4MAATUY7R4yvNjXSQiQF/content/f500790ffbf976086184a499c5105abdaadd017927fade2147772deb58cd2ca9.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","sizeBytes":188031,"sha256":"f500790ffbf976086184a499c5105abdaadd017927fade2147772deb58cd2ca9"},{"assetId":"step-03","role":"content","url":"https://wancai-beijing.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/public-action/1s4MAATUY7R4yvNjXSQiQF/content/659acc924377cd77c3ae330da7d2ec7507b0f7b3c89cbd2eca7fff74b0b1eeb9.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","sizeBytes":168663,"sha256":"659acc924377cd77c3ae330da7d2ec7507b0f7b3c89cbd2eca7fff74b0b1eeb9"},{"assetId":"step-04","ro